{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VUwZHjiEHhx8V5vK8b1ePF","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"pixel-engine\",\n  \"version\": \"0.46.0\",\n  \"build\": \"2026-11-02 f75d4a6\",\n  \"source\": \"https://github.com/michaelcrosato/riftlight\",\n  \"latest\": \"https://github.com/michaelcrosato/riftlight/releases/latest/download/pixel-engine.zip\",\n  \"releases\": \"https://github.com/michaelcrosato/riftlight/releases\",\n  \"entry\": \"pixel-engine.js\",\n  \"readFirst\": [\n    \"README.md\",\n    \"GUIDE.md\"\n  ],\n  \"starter\": {\n    \"page\": \"index.html\",\n    \"script\": \"game.js\"\n  },\n  \"examples\": [\n    \"examples/side-scroller.html\",\n    \"examples/top-down.html\",\n    \"examples/looks.html\",\n    \"examples/market.html\"\n  ],\n  \"assets\": {\n    \"guide\": \"ASSETS.md\",\n    \"library\": \"LIBRARY.md\",\n    \"index\": \"library.json\",\n    \"packs\": \"packs/index.json\",\n    \"credits\": \"CREDITS.md\"\n  },\n  \"builtinModels\": [\n   5143 API.md\n    283 ASSETS.md\n    842 CHANGELOG.md\n    256 CREDITS.md\n   1115 GUIDE.md\n   1153 LIBRARY.md\n     34 README.md\n    103 game.js\n     14 index.html\n    578 pixel-engine.js\n    586 check.mjs\n  10107 total\nexamples:\ntotal 56\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha 4096 Nov  5 16:21 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 micha micha 4096 Nov  5 16:21 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  509 Dec 31  1979 looks.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 4371 Dec 31  1979 looks.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 1074 Dec 31  1979 market-models.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  511 Dec 31  1979 market.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 3166 Dec 31  1979 market.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  525 Dec 31  1979 side-scroller.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 7059 Dec 31  1979 side-scroller.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  515 Dec 31  1979 top-down.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 7469 Dec 31  1979 top-down.js\n\npacks:\ntotal 2892\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  5 16:21 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 micha micha    4096 Nov  5 16:21 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha    2886 Dec 31  1979 index.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  506467 Dec 31  1979 kenney-castle.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  675400 Dec 31  1979 kenney-furniture.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  133943 Dec 31  1979 kenney-mini-dungeon.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 1151824 Dec 31  1979 kenney-nature.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  238973 Dec 31  1979 kenney-tiny-dungeon.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  229660 Dec 31  1979 kenney-tiny-town.json\n\ntypes:\ntotal 20\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 micha micha 4096 Nov  5 16:21 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 micha micha 4096 Nov  5 16:21 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 micha micha  336 Dec 31  1979 bundle.d.ts\ndrwxr-xr-x 15 micha micha 4096 Nov  5 16:21 engine\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 micha micha 4096 Nov  5 16:21 game\n# Changelog\n\nWhat changed in Pixel Engine for a game built on it, newest first. The version is\n`package.json`'s; a game reads it as `ENGINE_VERSION`, `Engine.version` or\n`engine.state().version`. The engine kit (`npm run bundle`, docs/GUIDE.md) ships this file.\n\nWhen a change alters the public API (`src/bundle.ts` exports) or something a game can see,\nbump the version (minor while it is 0.x) and add its section here; `npm test` fails when\n`package.json`'s version has no section.\n\n## 0.46.0\n\n- **No more handoff page**: the engine's site is gone, so `manifest.json` has no `handoff` and the\n  kit's `README.md` no longer names a page for agents. Newer kits are where they were:\n  `latest` (the newest release's zip), `releases` and `source`.\n\n## 0.45.0\n\n- **The kit runs in Node**: `Engine.headless(game, { assets })` from `pixel-engine.js` alone, with\n  no `node_modules`. In Node, Rapier's wasm comes from the data URL the kit inlines, and a reader\n  (`assets`, `setAssetReader`) no longer sees the files the kit embeds (`__PIXEL_ASSETS__`: the\n  built-in models load as they do in a page).\n- **`node check.mjs --headless game.js`**: plays a game module in Node, no browser. It makes the game\n  with the module's `createGame()` export, plays the `--keys` frames, replays the recording in a\n  fresh game and writes `report.json` (`state()`, errors, the fingerprint). Exit 1 on an error or a\n  replay that ends elsewhere, 2 for a page or a module without `createGame()`.\n- **The starter `game.js` exports `createGame()`** and starts the engine only where there is a\n  `document`, so it imports in Node. GUIDE.md section 8, *Play it in Node*, shows a test of your own.\n\n## 0.44.0\n\n- **Removed from the texture library: its equipment icons**: `sword-icon`, `axe-icon`,\n  `mace-icon`, `dagger-icon`, `bow-icon`, `staff-icon`, `wand-icon`, `shield-icon`,\n  `round-shield-icon`, `quiver-icon`, `helmet-icon`, `armor-icon`, `gloves-icon`, `boots-icon`,\n  `belt-icon`, `ring` and `amulet`. They were a second way to draw an item next to Riftlight's own\n  icons, which fill any item footprint (a one-cell item's box is 7 px wide), and nothing used them. A game that wants one makes its own\n  `TextureDef` (docs/GUIDE-ASSETS.md) and adds it with `TEXTURE_LIBRARY.add(def)`. The library\n  keeps the items Riftlight has no class for (potions, key, scroll, map, book, bomb, torch...),\n  `gem-icon`, `gold-icon`, the skill and UI icons and the creatures.\n\n## 0.43.0\n\n- **`Game.args`**: the plain JSON a game was made with, when its name alone can't rebuild it (a\n  lab's depth and seed, the door a room was entered by). Recordings keep it (**`Recording.args`**),\n  so a tool can make the same game again and replay one (`npm run replay` in this repository).\n\n## 0.42.0\n\n- **`Engine.headless(game, options)`: games without a page** (docs/engine/headless.md). The same\n  boot, game code and frames as `Engine.start`, in Node: no GPU, DOM or listeners, manual time from\n  the start (`step()`, `input.setKey` / `send`, `replay()`), errors in `engine.errors`. Options add\n  `viewport` (default 960×540 at DPR 1) and `assets`.\n- **`engine.renderer` is a `View`**: what gameplay reads from a view (art resolution, framing,\n  `viewport`, look, mode, filters, `screen`, `capture()`), the page's `PixelRenderer` or a\n  `HeadlessView`. Direct GPU work goes through **`engine.gpu`** (the `PixelRenderer`, null\n  headless): `engine.renderer.renderer` becomes `engine.gpu.renderer`. `BackendName` gains\n  `'headless'`.\n- **The GPU helpers take the view**: `swarm.update(engine.renderer, dt)` (was\n  `engine.renderer.renderer`), `mirror.attach(engine.renderer, scene)` and\n  `view.attach(engine.renderer, scene)` as before; headless they do nothing.\n80408b4c72ef08be3ec628d578f8b008644c1c7e447a4cc8c5979b08212e78aa  pixel-engine.js","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"76d12802-c986-437e-adae-1ae347966275","uuid":"49d60812-0901-409e-bfe5-ab990169d1f9","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:21:15.397Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"name\": \"pixel-engine\",\n  \"version\": \"0.46.0\",\n  \"build\": \"2026-11-02 f75d4a6\",\n  \"source\": \"https://github.com/michaelcrosato/riftlight\",\n  \"latest\": \"https://github.com/michaelcrosato/riftlight/releases/latest/download/pixel-engine.zip\",\n  \"releases\": \"https://github.com/michaelcrosato/riftlight/releases\",\n  \"entry\": \"pixel-engine.js\",\n  \"readFirst\": [\n    \"README.md\",\n    \"GUIDE.md\"\n  ],\n  \"starter\": {\n    \"page\": \"index.html\",\n    \"script\": \"game.js\"\n  },\n  \"examples\": [\n    \"examples/side-scroller.html\",\n    \"examples/top-down.html\",\n    \"examples/looks.html\",\n    \"examples/market.html\"\n  ],\n  \"assets\": {\n    \"guide\": \"ASSETS.md\",\n    \"library\": \"LIBRARY.md\",\n    \"index\": \"library.json\",\n    \"packs\": \"packs/index.json\",\n    \"credits\": \"CREDITS.md\"\n  },\n  \"builtinModels\": [\n   5143 API.md\n    283 ASSETS.md\n    842 CHANGELOG.md\n    256 CREDITS.md\n   1115 GUIDE.md\n   1153 LIBRARY.md\n     34 README.md\n    103 game.js\n     14 index.html\n    578 pixel-engine.js\n    586 check.mjs\n  10107 total\nexamples:\ntotal 56\ndrwxr-x