{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgknuu6GQuPDqu9db1yWD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FUjHJD959R3mCSPDuRdMf2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'P'\nimport re\np='docs/TESTING.md';t=open(p).read()\nt=t.replace(\"31. C At time scale 0 pad presses were dropped: menus ignored the pad.\\n\",\"\")\nt=t.replace(\"## Browser and harness (11)\",\"## Browser and harness (10)\")\nn=[0]\ndef r(m): n[0]+=1; return f\"{n[0]}. \"\nt=re.sub(r'^\\d+\\. ',r,t,flags=re.M)\nitems=re.findall(r'^\\d+\\. (C )?',t,re.M); tot=len(items); cr=sum(1 for x in items if x)\nt=re.sub(r'Total: \\d+\\. Critical: \\d+\\.',f'Total: {tot}. Critical: {cr}.',t)\nopen(p,'w').write(t); print(tot,cr)\np='src/screens/../core/ui.js';s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"// Pads are read here directly: at time scale 0 the engine's input drops presses.\",\"// Pads are read here directly so menus get the left stick and edges in one place.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/data/about.js';s=open(p).read()\na=s.index(\"export const TESTING_FEEDBACK\"); b=s.index(\"export const ENGINE_FEEDBACK\")\ns=s[:a]+f\"\"\"export const TESTING_FEEDBACK = [\n  ['How many issues did testing catch?', '{tot}, itemised in docs/TESTING.md: 21 from the whole-game bot playthrough, 8 from the node suites, 10 from browser and harness runs, 9 from captures, 1 from checking the code against the plan. Bugs in the bot or the tests themselves are not counted, and how to split or merge an issue is a judgement call.'],\n  ['How many would be considered critical issues / game breaking?', '{cr}. For example: reloading a checkpoint left the game stuck; set pieces changed shared level data and broke every retry; a mid-vault checkpoint put you inside a wall; the road had no door action; the final boss could not be hurt; launch mines could not be shot; Night Shift crashed on its first frame; opening the Case with Triangle dropped your gun; Esc opened Pause and shut it in the same frame; hub traffic starved under slow rendering.'],\n  ['What was the most helpful test you ran?', 'The scripted whole-game playthrough in Node. It runs about 60 times faster than real time, so one run of the entire game took under a minute, and it found most of the game-breaking bugs.'],\n  ['What was the least helpful test you ran?', 'The per-sound render checks. They stayed green after the first run. They guard against typos, but never found a gameplay problem.'],\n];\n\"\"\"+s[b:]\ns=s.replace(\" Pad presses are dropped at time scale 0, so I had to read pads myself in menus.\",\" I also wrongly blamed dropped pad presses at time scale 0 for a menu bug that was my own; a direct test showed pad presses work there.\")\ns=s.replace(\"Let gamepad presses reach wasPressed at time scale 0, the way keyboard presses do, so a frozen menu needs no separate pad reading. An official shoulder-offset third-person rig would also save replacing rig.step by hand.\",\"An official shoulder-offset third-person rig, so a game need not replace rig.step by hand.\")\ns=s.replace(\"I could not judge game feel with hands on a pad here, only through the bot and screenshots.\",\"I could not judge game feel with hands on a pad here, only through the bot and screenshots.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nP\ngrep -n \"dropped\\|time scale\" src/data/about.js | cut -c1-120 | head; (timeout 595 node tools/test.mjs 2>&1 | cut -c1-300 | tail -8)","description":"Correct the log and feedback; run the full suite on the final code","timeout":599000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1809,"cache_read_input_tokens":793478,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1809},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"