gle dropped your gun; Esc opened Pause and shut it in the same frame; hub traffic starved under slow rendering.'],\n  ['What was the most helpful test you ran?', 'The scripted whole-game playthrough in Node. It runs about 60 times faster than real time, so one run of the entire game took under a minute, and it found most of the game-breaking bugs.'],\n  ['What was the least helpful test you ran?', 'The per-sound render checks. They stayed green after the first run. They guard against typos, but never found a gameplay problem.'],\n];\n\"\"\"+s[b:]\ns=s.replace(\" Pad presses are dropped at time scale 0, so I had to read pads myself in menus.\",\" I also wrongly blamed dropped pad presses at time scale 0 for a menu bug that was my own; a direct test showed pad presses work there.\")\ns=s.replace(\"Let gamepad presses reach wasPressed at time scale 0, the way keyboard presses do, so a frozen menu needs no separate pad reading. An official shoulder-offset third-person rig would also save replacing rig.step by hand.\",\"An official shoulder-offset third-person rig, so a game need not replace rig.step by hand.\")\ns=s.replace(\"I could not judge game feel with hands on a pad here, only through the bot and screenshots.\",\"I could not judge game feel with hands on a pad here, only through the bot and screenshots.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nP\ngrep -n \"dropped\\|time scale\" src/data/about.js | cut -c1-120 | head; (timeout 595 node tools/test.mjs 2>&1 | cut -c1-300 | tail -8)","description":"Correct the log and feedback; run the full suite on the final code","timeout":599000}}}
