{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkpwWzXtKyzD6xdBMRDj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Reachability and end-of-game captures are done; one item can't be done here\n\nThe full suite now passes 1016 of 1016 on the final code. That includes the engine kit's own `check.mjs`, the four AI Hub scenarios and the whole-game bot run.\n\n## What I closed\n**Reachability is now shown at runtime, not by reading source.**\n- **Enemies:** in a single bot run, all 12 enemy types actually spawned, including Re-Salted and the Boat Harpooner.\n- **Items and weapons:** a new sweep goes through each area using the real prompts and Shop screen. It opens every chest, takes every pickup and buys all stock, and every item and weapon was obtained. The Cold Room key and Black Pearl are confirmed separately, as drops in the bot run.\n- **Notes and merchant:** all six Claim Notes get read, and Mr. Fathom opens his shop in all six places he appears.\n\n**End-of-game screens at 4:3 and 1080p.** I captured and reviewed the Final Claim Form, the credits mid-scroll and the last shot. The earlier blank-looking capture was just the very start of the scroll.\n\n**A real bug that capture found:** the limpet in the game's closing image was buried inside the hull and couldn't be seen. It's now on the stern, opening in the dawn light. This brings the log in `docs/TESTING.md` to **50 issues, 14 critical**, and the About screen and `exit-interview.json` are updated to match.\n\n**Two intermittent test failures:** both showed up with the machine under heavy load from other agents.\n- **Phone Settings tap:** this was the test's fixed wait, and a tap during a clip load is lost; it now waits and taps again. So that loss can still happen in the game, but the next tap works.\n- **Earlier crash:** I lost that traceback, so idling into attract mode mid-test is only my best guess at the cause. I closed that race and it hasn't come back.\n\n## What can't be done here\n**The game can't run in Firefox or WebKit on this computer.** The engine is WebGPU-only, and `TASK.md` lists WebGPU only for Chromium here. The plan's own test for those browsers is that the clear message appears and nothing else breaks, and that passes on Firefox, WebKit and WebKit with an iPhone profile. Whether the game itself plays in those browsers with WebGPU is **untested**.\n\nNo further work on this computer can settle these either:\n- Nobody has played it, so feel and balance are tuned only against the bot.\n- Real controllers, phones, speakers and TVs were only stood in for.\n\nThe Source Information and the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback from my earlier message still stand, with these updates:\n- Testing Feedback now reads 50 issues, with 10 of them from captures.\n- The last-shot fix adds to the capture findings.\n- Reachability is now checked at runtime.\n\nThe current text of all of it is on the About screen and in `exit-interview.json`.\n\nTo rerun the suite, first run `npm install` in the dev folder.\n\nEverything is in `/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-162048__xa8053f/work`:\n- `PresidentEvil4-ResidentEvil4-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-162048.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `PresidentEvil4-ResidentEvil4-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-162048/`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_read_input_tokens":823663,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725},"output_tokens":711,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"76d12802-c986-437e-adae-1ae347966275","uuid":"6d4d7ba2-afe4-4a90-a9f5-1033f4f25e40","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:44:17.957Z","request_id":"req_011CgkpwWV1s54gC6VkaVSai"}
