{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvEZEX28b9EUtEvGctw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# President Evil 4: complete on this computer\n\nThe full suite now passes **1163 of 1163**, in one run that includes every test I've added. The game file hasn't changed since the previous report.\n\n## What this round closed\n- **Full run:** the per-weapon damage, stagger odds, kick cone, pad exit from attract and WebRTC results tests now run in the same pass as everything else.\n- **Mood captures:** dusk, rain, moon, abbey, indoor, cold room and dawn were each captured at 4:3 and 1920×1080. The contact sheets are shown above: all rendered without errors and the HUD fits at both sizes. The Case, Shop, title and pause were captured at both sizes earlier.\n\n## What remains can't be done on this computer\n- **Human play:** there's no person here, so the bot and the sweep are the evidence for reachability, and nobody has judged feel or balance.\n- **Real hardware:** `TASK.md` says this computer has no physical controller, touch device, listener, real iPhone or TV, and that anything needing the real thing is \"never required\". I used the stand-ins it names.\n- **WebKit:** it has no WebGPU here, even launched directly with its feature on, and the engine needs WebGPU, so the game can't run there. It shows the clear message the plan expects.\n- **Firefox:** it needs WebGPU forced on and a virtual display on this computer. With those, the game, the AI Hub harness and parties all pass.\n\nMore runs can't change any of these, so this is my final report on this goal. If you want them checked, someone needs to play the game on real hardware.\n\n## Source Information and feedback\nAll of it is unchanged from my previous message, which has the full text, and the same answers are on the in-game About screen and in `exit-interview.json`. Testing Feedback reads 52 issues, 15 critical.\n\nTo rerun the suite, first run `npm install` in the dev folder.\n\nEverything is in `/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-162048__xa8053f/work`:\n- `PresidentEvil4-ResidentEvil4-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-162048.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `PresidentEvil4-ResidentEvil4-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-162048/`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":260,"cache_read_input_tokens":915427,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":260},"output_tokens":708,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"76d12802-c986-437e-adae-1ae347966275","uuid":"92ceb65a-7607-47c6-b3f8-0daf9f8d2d9c","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:53:39.425Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvEYsT61GH7DPNH58EA"}
